<title>MALAYSIA: Telekom Malaysia 1996 net 1.88 bln rgt.</title>
<headline>Telekom Malaysia 1996 net 1.88 bln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	   1,881.4	  vs    1,575.1</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)     94.3	  vs	 79.1</p>
<p>    Turnover	     6,416.3	  vs    5,252.8</p>
<p>    Pretax profit	2,388.1	  vs    1,933.7</p>
<p>    Minorities   less     12.3	  vs add   1.6</p>
<p>    Final div    (pct)    17.5	  vs	15.0</p>
<p>Note - Telekom Malaysia Bhd is the country's dominant telecommunications firm.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
